 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
 ## [Unreleased]
+
+- **Config and translation keys follow imported aliases and named arguments.** Completion and navigation identify the actual helper or facade; local names keep their own meaning and config value types survive aliased calls. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Scope method bodies keep the model type through attribute aliases.** Suggestions and diagnostics follow the imported Eloquent attribute, and ordinary methods no longer borrow a neighboring or unrelated Scope attribute. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
